    of face-up monsters without a Level that were Special Summoned from the Extra
    Deck. If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) (except during the Damage
    Step): You can add 1 "Ursarctic" card from your Deck to your hand. You can only
    use this effect of "Ursarctic Septentrion" once per turn.'
